  "title": "Ethiopian Chinese Cabbage Stew",
  "description": "A comforting and peppery stew featuring Chinese cabbage and rest-meat, made with low-fat friendly ingredients. This dish is a unique fusion of Ethiopian and Chinese flavors.",
